        <strong>What you can do:</strong> Build ReAct agents with tools, connect to 4 LLM providers, manage knowledge bases, enforce safety guardrails, monitor via Prometheus/Grafana/Langfuse, and orchestrate workflows — all from a unified dashboard.
      </div>

